# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Brand migration: fiatrails.network -> netta.network
# Settlement Computer marketing site moved to NETTA brand.
# Path-preserving 301 with forced redirect (!) so existing
# content at netta.network does not short-circuit the rule.

